  "solution": "def add_matrices(x: list[list[int]], y: list[list[int]]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    return [[x[r][c] + y[r][c] for c in range(len(x[0]))] for r in range(len(x))]\n",
  "explanation": "Performs cell-by-cell matrix addition in O(M*N) time."
